      "action_format_note": "LeRobot action vector is 17-dim: [0:7]=left joints, [7]=left gripper, [8:15]=right joints, [15]=right gripper, [16]=constant 434.0 (likely pedal/base config, not a variable command).",
      "required_topic_keys": [
